# djump table — edit freely (one entry per line)
# Format:  key   path
# Used as dKEY in Jump mode (e.g. key "home" → type dhome)
# Paths: ~ expands; relative paths (e.g. ..) are relative to current $PWD
#
# key     path
home      ~
bk        ..
etc       /etc
con       ~/.config
doc       ~/Documents
down      ~/Downloads
game      ~/Games
music     ~/Music
pub       ~/Public
pic       ~/Pictures
proj      ~/Projects
vid       ~/Videos
app       /usr/share/applications
eb        ~/Eb_Transfer
apps      ~/Apps
share     ~/.local/share
